# Normalize line endings: every text file is LF in the repo. Stops the CRLF churn that
# whole-file rewrites from other harnesses introduced (2026-08-01 collision).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never apply CRLF conversion to CA certs — a security artifact the executor image
# installs into its trust store. Keep byte-for-byte across platforms/clones.
*.crt -text
*.pem -text
